# Files that belong in the repo but not on the web server.
#
# Vercel serves the deployment directory as static files, so everything checked
# in was reachable over HTTP — including the deploy scripts and the working
# notes. None of it is secret, but none of it is part of the app either.
#
# Anything not listed here still ships. The app itself is index.html, cities.js,
# sw.js, manifest.json and the icons; probe.html stays deployed on purpose,
# because diagnosing an EXIF problem means opening it on the phone that has the
# photos.

# Working notes and documentation
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# Build tooling — cities.js is generated locally and committed, so the
# generator itself is never needed at deploy time.
build-cities.js

# Deploy helpers, Windows-only and irrelevant to the served site
deploy.ps1
watch-deploy.ps1

# Repo configuration
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.claude/
